"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":11,"created_at":"2025-01-31T10:56:22Z","updated_at":"2025-02-12T08:09:05Z","closed_at":"2025-02-03T14:23:40Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in v4.4.beta2.mono.official [a013481b0]\n- NOT Reproducible in v4.4.beta1.mono.official [d33da79d3]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta2.mono - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6094) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-3570K CPU @ 3.40GHz (4 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nIt seems that even if Godot is able to handle external changes to files through the language server, changes are still treated like they were \"external changes\". Even after told to reload from disk, the file is considered being changed and \"Files have been modified outside Godot\" dialog is displayed whenever Godot gets focus.\n\nMy \"Auto Reload Scripts on External Change\" setting is disabled (default value). If I change that setting to enabled, the problem goes away, but my understanding is that the language server should handle this situation with the default setting (no auto reload) and auto reload should only be used when the external editor doesn't support language server.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Open Godot and start a new project\n1. Open external editor, eg. vscode. Make sure external editor connects to the language server\n1. Keep both Godot and external editor visible\n1. Add a GDScript file to the project \n1. Edit GDScript file using the external editor => You can see the change appearing to Godot's code editor as expected\n1. Switch focus back to Godot \n=> **\"Files have been modified outside Godot\" BUG This shouldn't happen.**\n\n1. Click \"Reload from disk\" \n1. Switch focus out from Godot (doesn't need to focus to the external editor)\n1. Switch focus back to Godot\n=> **\"Files have been modified outside Godot\" BUG This happens again.**\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102234/reactions","total_count":6,"+1":6,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102234/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}